<h1>Low Stock Alert</h1>

<p><%= @client_inventory.client.company_name %>,</p>

<p>One of your inventory items has dropped to or below its low-stock threshold and may need to be reordered soon.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;"><%= @product.name %></h2>

    <p><strong>Color:</strong> <%= @variant.color.presence || "N/A" %></p>
    <p><strong>Size:</strong> <%= @variant.size.presence || "N/A" %></p>
    <p><strong>Current quantity:</strong> <%= @client_inventory.quantity %> units</p>
    <p><strong>Low stock threshold:</strong> <%= @client_inventory.minimum_quantity %> units</p>
</div>

<% if @reorder_catalog.present? %>
<p>
    <a href="<%= storefront_product_url(@product.product_id, catalog_id: @reorder_catalog.id) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #db2777; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">
        Reorder now
    </a>
</p>
<% end %>

<p>Should you have any questions or require further assistance, please do not hesitate to contact our customer service team.</p>

<p>Thank you for choosing ShirtPop!<br>
